{%- comment -%}
  B2B 注文リクエストフォーム（商品詳細ページ用）
  =====================================================================
  法人顧客向けに、通常の「カートに追加」ボタンの代わりに
  数量入力 + 注文リクエストボタンを表示する。

  Phase1 の B2B 注文フロー: 電話 → 営業が Draft Order 作成
  このフォームはデモ用 UI。実際の注文は営業経由で処理。

  Accepts:
    - product: {Object} 商品 Liquid オブジェクト（必須）
    - block: {Object} ブロック情報（必須）
    - section_id: {String} セクション ID

  組み込み方法:
    main-product.liquid の buy_buttons ブロック内で
    B2B 顧客判定後に render:

      {% render 'b2b-order-form', product: product, block: block, section_id: section.id %}
{%- endcomment -%}

<div {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {%- if product != blank -%}
    {%- assign b2b_variant = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
    {%- assign group = customer.metafields.b2b.discount_group.value -%}
    {%- assign category = product.metafields.b2b.category.value -%}
    {%- assign rate = 1.0 -%}

    {%- assign overrides = customer.metafields.b2b.custom_overrides.value -%}
    {%- if overrides != blank and category != blank and overrides[category] -%}
      {%- assign rate = overrides[category] -%}
    {%- elsif group != blank and category != blank -%}
      {%- for entry in shop.metaobjects.discount_matrix.values -%}
        {%- if entry.group.value == group and entry.category.value == category -%}
          {%- assign rate = entry.discount_rate.value -%}
          {%- break -%}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    {%- endif -%}

    {%- if rate < 1.0 -%}
      {%- assign wholesale_price = b2b_variant.price | times: rate -%}
    {%- else -%}
      {%- assign wholesale_price = b2b_variant.price -%}
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="b2b-order-form" style="
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
      padding: 1.25rem;
      border: 2px solid #1a3a6b;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: #f4f7fc;
    ">
      <div style="
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #1a3a6b;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      ">法人注文</div>

      <div style="
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 1rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      ">
        <label for="b2b-qty-{{ section_id }}" style="
          font-size: 0.85rem;
          font-weight: 600;
          color: #333;
          white-space: nowrap;
        ">数量:</label>
        <div style="
          display: flex;
          align-items: center;
          border: 1.5px solid #ccc;
          border-radius: 6px;
          overflow: hidden;
          background: #fff;
        ">
          <button type="button" class="b2b-qty-btn" onclick="
            var el = document.getElementById('b2b-qty-{{ section_id }}');
            var v = parseInt(el.value) || 1;
            if (v > 1) { el.value = v - 1; updateB2bSubtotal{{ section_id | replace: '-', '_' }}(); }
          " style="
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border: none;
            background: #f0f0f0;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #333;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
          ">−</button>
          <input
            type="number"
            id="b2b-qty-{{ section_id }}"
            value="1"
            min="1"
            max="999"
            oninput="updateB2bSubtotal{{ section_id | replace: '-', '_' }}()"
            style="
              width: 60px;
              height: 36px;
              border: none;
              text-align: center;
              font-size: 1rem;
              font-weight: 600;
              -moz-appearance: textfield;
            "
          >
          <button type="button" class="b2b-qty-btn" onclick="
            var el = document.getElementById('b2b-qty-{{ section_id }}');
            var v = parseInt(el.value) || 1;
            el.value = v + 1; updateB2bSubtotal{{ section_id | replace: '-', '_' }}();
          " style="
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border: none;
            background: #f0f0f0;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #333;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
          ">+</button>
        </div>
        <span id="b2b-subtotal-{{ section_id }}" style="
          font-size: 0.95rem;
          color: #555;
        ">小計: {{ wholesale_price | money }}</span>
      </div>

      <a
        href="/pages/contact"
        class="b2b-order-request-btn"
        style="
          display: block;
          width: 100%;
          padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
          background: #1a3a6b;
          color: #fff;
          font-size: 1rem;
          font-weight: 700;
          text-align: center;
          text-decoration: none;
          border: none;
          border-radius: 8px;
          cursor: pointer;
          transition: background 0.2s;
          box-sizing: border-box;
        "
        onmouseover="this.style.background='#15305a'"
        onmouseout="this.style.background='#1a3a6b'"
      >
        注文のお問い合わせ
      </a>

      <p style="
        font-size: 0.72rem;
        color: #888;
        margin: 0.75rem 0 0 0;
        line-height: 1.5;
        text-align: center;
      ">
        ※ 法人のご注文は担当営業が承ります。お電話またはお問い合わせフォームよりご連絡ください。
      </p>
    </div>

    <script>
      function updateB2bSubtotal{{ section_id | replace: '-', '_' }}() {
        var qty = parseInt(document.getElementById('b2b-qty-{{ section_id }}').value) || 1;
        var unitPrice = Math.round({{ wholesale_price }} / 100);
        var subtotal = (qty * unitPrice).toLocaleString('ja-JP');
        document.getElementById('b2b-subtotal-{{ section_id }}').textContent = '小計: ¥' + subtotal;
      }
    </script>

    <style>
      .b2b-order-form input[type="number"]::-webkit-outer-spin-button,
      .b2b-order-form input[type="number"]::-webkit-inner-spin-button {
        -webkit-appearance: none;
        margin: 0;
      }
      @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
        .b2b-order-form {
          padding: 1rem !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
